      "title": "A launch worth remembering",
      "createdAt": 1792497500000,
      "updatedAt": 1792497600000,
      "model": "auto",
      "messages": [
        {
          "id": "question",
          "role": "user",
          "text": "I’m launching a small design studio. Help me make a focused first-week plan — something I can actually follow.",
          "createdAt": 1792497510000
        },
        {
          "id": "answer",
          "role": "assistant",
          "model": "gemini:gemini-flash-latest",
          "route": "writing · balanced",
          "status": "done",
          "createdAt": 1792497520000,
          "text": "## Make the first week count.\n\nYou don’t need a louder launch. You need a clear offer, a small audience, and a reason for them to come back.\n\n### Lead with one strong idea\nDescribe the problem you solve in one sentence. Pair it with **one excellent piece of work**, rather than an entire portfolio.\n\n### A week with a little structure\n\n| When | Focus | Something finished |\n|---|---|---|\n| Monday | Define the offer | One clear project page |\n| Tuesday–Wednesday | Start conversations | Five personal introductions |\n| Thursday–Friday | Listen and refine | A stronger second version |\n\nKeep the work small enough to finish. The goal is **five useful conversations**, not five hundred impressions.\n\nWould you like to turn Monday into a checklist?"
        }
      ]
    },
